B) Adaptive loop (the main “adaptive tutor” core)

Right now you accept student_state, but the system should update it automatically:

After quiz grading:

identify weak concepts

update mastery/confidence scores

choose next lesson difficulty + focus topics

Add endpoint like:

/student_state/update or return updated state from /quiz/submit

C) Diagnosis module (skill-gap detection)

If you already have diagnose.py route + diagnoser agent, wire it into:

“before learning”: diagnose baseline

“after quiz”: diagnose misconceptions

generate remediation plan

D) Make the lesson audio actually sync (optional but next-level)

Right now you merge one long narration with a video of fixed waits → it works, but it won’t be perfectly aligned.
Next upgrade:

TTS per segment

merge per-segment durations

or create subtitles (.srt) from segment narration

E) Frontend essentials

Start lesson → poll status → video player

Quiz UI → submit answers → show feedback + mastery

F) Persistence (DB)

